# Physical mods (!lctl) - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_physical_mods.kbd)
**!lctl + a**         -- Select All Text
**!lctl + b**         -- Bold Text
**!lctl + e**         -- Toggle Edit Mode
**!lctl + p**         -- Select Files
**!lctl + r**         -- Toggle Source Mode
**!lctl + ,**         -- Setting
**!lctl + lsft + p**  -- Commands
**lctl + tab**        -- Walk Through Apps
**lctl + `**          -- Walk Through Same App
**lctl + b**          -- Page Up
**lctl + f**          -- Page Down
**lctl + t**          -- New Tab
**lctl + ,**          -- Setting
**lctl + ;**          -- Vimola
**lctl + [**          -- Forward
**lctl + ]**          -- Backward
**seek + spc**        -- Seek And Select File
**lctl + lsft + t**   -- Undo Close Tab
**seek + lsft + spc** -- Seek And Select Folder
